# A lavender sleep mask with a pixel moon. `sleep-mask-up` is pushed up on the forehead (the eye
# shows), `sleep-mask-down` is pulled over the eye for a nap. The elastic runs round the back of
# the head. Both frames share the face anchor.
name: sleep-mask
size: 12x11
anchor: face 8 8
palette:
  K #2a1f2d
  P #6c5ce7
  L #a29bfe
  M #ffeaa7

@frame sleep-mask-up
............
...KKKKKKK..
...KLMMPPK..
..KKLMPPPK..
.KPKPMMPPK..
KPK.KKKKKK..
.K..........
............
............
............
............

@frame sleep-mask-down
............
............
............
............
............
......KKKKK.
.KKKKKLLMMPK
.PPPPKLPMPPK
.KKKKKLPMMPK
.....KPPPPPK
......KKKKK.
